"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/cnc-lathe-set-up-and-operators\",\"title\":\"CNC LATHE SET/UP AND OPERATORS | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"7eed2b746632f1eca4cf14ca126fcbf2c055286bb967c8b5af090084ff1cb3f2\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nCNC Lathe Setup & Operator\\n\\nThis position is responsible for set-up and operating of HAAS 2 Axis Lathes and Omni Turn CNCs.\\n\\nResponsible for the proper use of all measuring tools and devices used in inspections of all components. Works under general supervision.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nEssential Job Functions include the following, but are not limited to:\\n\\nWorking knowledge of ISO quality Regulations & procedures\\n\\nResponsible for set-up and operation of machines listed above in compliance with inch and metric drawing specifications\\n\\nPossess the ability to set up and operate, lathes and other secondary equipment\\n\\nThorough understanding of blueprint reading\\n\\nWorks independently and inspects work to the specified standards on the drawings\\n\\nGeneral housekeeping in the work area which includes preventative maintenance on the machines\\n\\nPerform other duties as required to ensure efficient operation of the shop\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nExperience:\\n\\nMinimum 3 years of experience in a similar position is a plus\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nEducation:\\n\\nHigh School Diploma or equivalent or equivalent work experience\\n\\nCNC Certification or CNC Trade School a major plus\\n\\nCNC Lathe Programming knowledge is required\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nSpecialized Knowledge and Skills:\\n\\nKnowledge of medical products a plus\\n\\nStrong sense of ownership and work ethic\\n\\nGood communication skills\\n\\n\\u00a0\\n\\nJob Type: Full-time\\n\\n\\u200bPay: $15.00 - $28.00 per hour\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
